@Borovski213my dad has had an android for like two or three decades however long they have existed he has had one I have many friends with androids as well. I do not like them I’ve literally sold the ones my dad offered that were newer than my iPhone 5 mini that I had until just before the X came out and I hated giving up.

Also ironically the only options were an16 pro or an android and now I’m getting a 16 pro. I didn’t want a new phone. I don’t want a new phone but to keep this one it would’ve cost more than the cost of the pro. 
And if you are mopping your floor with an android than I want one even less now.

11.35 part niya ekta kotha chilo. About Portrait. 3x e Portrait use kori iPhone 15 e. Just photo zoom korar moto kore Pinch kore apni apnar moto kore portrait tulte parben. Not just 1x or 2x or 3x. you can customize it like 1.7x or 2.3x whatever you want. between 1x to 3x

